Tools & Technologies Used 
Network & Web Protection
- **Cloudflare Proxy**  
  - Reverse proxy deployment
  - Origin IP masking
  - Traffic filtering and exposure reduction

Web Server Hardening
- **.htaccess Security Configuration**
  - HTTPS enforcement
  - HTTP security headers (CSP, XFO, XCTO, RP)
  - Directory listing prevention
  - Access restriction for sensitive files

Detection & Integrity Controls
- **Timestamp Observation**
  - File modification time monitoring
  - Unauthorized change detection

- **File Integrity Management (FIM)**
  - Monitoring of critical web and config files
  - Detection of unauthorized creation, modification, or deletion

Security Testing & Threat Intelligence
- **cURL**                   – Header inspection and redirect validation
- **SecurityHeaders.com**    – HTTP header analysis
- **Mozilla Observatory**    – Web security posture scoring
- **SSL Labs**               – TLS and certificate assessment
- **MXToolbox**              – DNS and email security validation
- **Google CSP Evaluator**   – CSP misconfiguration analysis
- **Shodan**                 – External exposure and service discovery
- **VirusTotal**             – Domain, IP, and URL reputation analysis
